    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "mental_model_text",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 475,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "🧠 Mental model\n\nKMS sees only the bucket-level key — never the per-object DEK, never the object bytes.\n\nThe top arrow (step 2/3) is the only network call.\n\nSteps 5–7 are pure local AES inside S3.\n\nThe durable map (step 4) is what makes step-2 amortise across many PUTs.",
      "originalText": "🧠 Mental model\n\nKMS sees only the bucket-level key — never the per-object DEK, never the object bytes.\n\nThe top arrow (step 2/3) is the only network call.\n\nSteps 5–7 are pure local AES inside S3.\n\nThe durable map (step 4) is what makes step-2 amortise across many PUTs.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
